{"content":[{"c":["ADAIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Josiah’s maternal grandfather. Josiah’s mother, Jedidah, was Adaiah’s daughter (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.22.1","r":"2Kgs.22.1","rawR":"2Kgs.22.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.22.1","value":"2Kgs.22.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 22:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ethan’s son, a Levite of the Gershon clan and an ancestor of Asaph the psalmist (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.41","r":"1Chr.6.41","rawR":"1Chr.6.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.41","value":"1Chr.6.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:41"},"). He is sometimes identified with the Iddo of ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.21","r":"1Chr.6.21","rawR":"1Chr.6.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.21","value":"1Chr.6.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 6:21"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Iddo_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Iddo_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Iddo_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Iddo #2"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Shimei’s son, a minor member of Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.21","r":"1Chr.8.21","rawR":"1Chr.8.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.21","value":"1Chr.8.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Jeroham’s son, a priest who returned to Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.12","r":"1Chr.9.12","rawR":"1Chr.9.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.12","value":"1Chr.9.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:12"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.12","r":"Neh.11.12","rawR":"Neh.11.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.12","value":"Neh.11.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Maaseiah’s father. Maaseiah was a captain under Jehoiada the priest (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","r":"2Chr.23.1","rawR":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.1","value":"2Chr.23.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 23:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Bani’s son, who obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce his pagan wife after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.29","r":"Ezra.10.29","rawR":"Ezra.10.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.29","value":"Ezra.10.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Son of a different Bani, who also obeyed that exhortation (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.39","r":"Ezra.10.39","rawR":"Ezra.10.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.39","value":"Ezra.10.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:39"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["8. Joiarib’s son, descended from Perez, and an ancestor of Maaseiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.5","r":"Neh.11.5","rawR":"Neh.11.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.5","value":"Neh.11.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Adaiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 22:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.22.1","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.22.1","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.22.1"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:41","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.41","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.41","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.41"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 6:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.21","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.21","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.21","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.21","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.12","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.12","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.12"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.12","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.12","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.12"},{"a